{
  "source": "Prompts/curiosity-1.mp4",
  "duration": 201.2009375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.92,
      "text": "Imagine you are the captain of your school's basketball team."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.7,
      "end": 6.08,
      "text": "You have a play that has worked beautifully all season,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.66,
      "end": 10.12,
      "text": "but suddenly another team figures out how to shut it down."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.74,
      "end": 13.42,
      "text": "Before you find a better play, you need to be curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.3,
      "end": 15.8,
      "text": "You have to diagnose the failure."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.76,
      "end": 18.64,
      "text": "What exactly is the opponent doing differently?"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.54,
      "end": 20.32,
      "text": "Where is the new opening?"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.96,
      "end": 22.72,
      "text": "What could you learn by watching that play again?"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.72,
      "end": 26.76,
      "text": "Taking an active interest like this, asking questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.76,
      "end": 29.86,
      "text": "and exploring new possibilities is a habit"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.86,
      "end": 31.62,
      "text": "that applies far beyond the court."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.22,
      "end": 34.88,
      "text": "Whether you are calling plays or mapping out a career,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.52,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "curiosity is the mandatory first step"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 39.42,
      "text": "for lifelong problem solving."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.08,
      "end": 41.28,
      "text": "There's always more to discover."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.34,
      "end": 44.2,
      "text": "To make curiosity a daily habit,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.48,
      "end": 46.58,
      "text": "you can break it down into four practical frameworks."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.36,
      "end": 49.24,
      "text": "First, use it as your armor."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 52.2,
      "text": "Influencers, advertisers, and algorithms"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.2,
      "end": 54.74,
      "text": "are constantly trying to shape what you think."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.36,
      "end": 57.02,
      "text": "When you encounter persuasive media,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.54,
      "end": 58.58,
      "text": "ask defensive questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.38,
      "end": 60.58,
      "text": "Who wants me to believe this?"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.18,
      "end": 61.74,
      "text": "What is the evidence?"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.5,
      "end": 64.36,
      "text": "And what crucial information is missing?"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.28,
      "end": 68.3,
      "text": "Second, curiosity is an immediate cure for boredom."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.96,
      "end": 70.88,
      "text": "A good question makes ordinary things interesting."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.64,
      "end": 73.5,
      "text": "Ask how a specific system works."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.18,
      "end": 76.28,
      "text": "Why people choose to do it that particular way"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.56,
      "end": 78.32,
      "text": "and consider what could be done differently?"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.22,
      "end": 81.1,
      "text": "Consistently asking least targeted questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.1,
      "end": 82.68,
      "text": "built a defensive shield."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.54,
      "end": 86.32,
      "text": "It protects your mind from being manipulated by others"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.32,
      "end": 89.68,
      "text": "and from becoming disengaged with the world around you."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.46,
      "end": 92.46,
      "text": "Curiosity also works on the offensive."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.34,
      "end": 95.24,
      "text": "You will receive critical feedback throughout your life"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.24,
      "end": 96.9,
      "text": "and approaching it with curiosity"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.9,
      "end": 98.64,
      "text": "prevents you from becoming defensive."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.78,
      "end": 102.1,
      "text": "Instead of shutting down, ask active questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.94,
      "end": 105.86,
      "text": "Find out exactly what worked, pinpoint what could improve,"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.46,
      "end": 108.12,
      "text": "and ask for a specific example"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.12,
      "end": 110.4,
      "text": "so you can extract actionable steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.16,
      "end": 114.08,
      "text": "Finally, curiosity is how you navigate a future"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.08,
      "end": 116.04,
      "text": "that feels completely unplanned."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.86,
      "end": 118.06,
      "text": "It is perfectly acceptable"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.06,
      "end": 120.28,
      "text": "if you do not have your life figured out today."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.94,
      "end": 124.68,
      "text": "The key is to stay engaged, try new things, meet new people,"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.16,
      "end": 128.04,
      "text": "and pay close attention to what genuinely captures your interest."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.86,
      "end": 130.18,
      "text": "Turning these questions outward"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.18,
      "end": 132.22,
      "text": "creates a proactive engine"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.22,
      "end": 133.9,
      "text": "for your own personal development."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.66,
      "end": 136.34,
      "text": "Let the things you discover organically"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.34,
      "end": 138.34,
      "text": "map out your next best step."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.12,
      "end": 141.98,
      "text": "Today, the rapid evolution of artificial intelligence"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.3,
      "end": 143.6,
      "text": "is the ultimate unknown."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.34,
      "end": 146.42,
      "text": "New models, tools, and workflows"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.42,
      "end": 147.9,
      "text": "keep appearing almost daily."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.86,
      "end": 151.08,
      "text": "You do not need to chase every single new feature."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.58,
      "end": 152.92,
      "text": "You only need to stay curious"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.92,
      "end": 155.34,
      "text": "about the changes that could actually matter to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.98,
      "end": 158.88,
      "text": "Use this four-part framework to stay AI curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.86,
      "end": 162.46,
      "text": "First, use AI regularly outside school"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.46,
      "end": 164.38,
      "text": "to notice when tools gain new abilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.08,
      "end": 167.36,
      "text": "Second, check occasionally for updates,"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.36,
      "end": 169.2,
      "text": "new buttons, or model names."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.94,
      "end": 172.38,
      "text": "Third, follow one reliable source"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.38,
      "end": 174.08,
      "text": "to prevent information overload."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.98,
      "end": 176.52,
      "text": "Fourth, compare with others."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.06,
      "end": 178.62,
      "text": "Different people notice different features."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.58,
      "end": 181.5,
      "text": "Applying this specific toolkit"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.5,
      "end": 182.9,
      "text": "prevents you from getting overwhelmed"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.9,
      "end": 184.32,
      "text": "by the pace of technology,"
    },
    {
      "start": 185.06,
      "end": 186.68,
      "text": "ensuring you continue to adapt"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.68,
      "end": 188.3,
      "text": "and grow alongside AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.26,
      "end": 192.16,
      "text": "Ultimately, building this habit guarantees one thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.16,
      "end": 194.18,
      "text": "Curiosity keeps you growing."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.92,
      "end": 195.64,
      "text": "Keep asking questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.64,
      "end": 197.56,
      "text": "Keep learning as you live."
    }
  ],
